WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.960
Now that you have learned the specific techniques for infants, we are going to

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:09.540
put it all together for our final scenario. Just like before, we want to

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:13.560
build that muscle memory so you can act without hesitation if the need ever

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:19.180
arises. As you work through this scenario, follow the four critical steps on the

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:23.959
screen. Once everyone is in position, your instructor will read the infant

00:00:23.959 --> 00:00:30.000
scenario out loud and begin circulating to evaluate your skills.

